  m_text: 'Welcome to the Tokyo Electron cleanroom! Open floor tiles are dangerous.
    Your job is to protect friendly robots from falling through them by placing barricades.

    Press
    the X button to spawn or grab a barricade. Use the Y button to rotate it. Release
    with X to drop it. Place a barricade in front of the open floor tile before the
    robot reaches it.

    A robot will begin walking toward the open floor tile.
    Block its path with a barricade before it falls through. Press START when you
    are ready.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
